                                "sense_id": "f52a1b37-c380-39df-bd69-44f2c4c76c1b",
                                "text": "Some of these were dressed most gorgeously, others becomingly, and several sneaked in with fantail bangers, calling themselves \"Gentlemen of the Nineteenth Century.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "290ecb9f-fa40-4049-8b98-23517966cd7c",
                                "sense_id": "f52a1b37-c380-39df-bd69-44f2c4c76c1b",
                                "text": "What other television show would feature a gorgeously designed sequence where a horrifically mutated Pierre and Marie Curie, their bodies swollen to Godzilla-like proportions from prolonged exposure to the radiation that would eventually kill them, destroy an Asian city with their bare hands like vengeance-crazed monster-Gods?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
